0..66 Comment "// This source applies univalence at a user-universe stratum code."
67..69 Comment "//"
70..147 Comment "// `ua[1, 4]` makes the magma degree telescope a path in `Type`. `univalence`"
148..218 Comment "// relates that path to an equivalence. `idtoequiv` packages the path."
219..221 Comment "//"
222..298 Comment "// Transport of the package along `ua` agrees pointwise with transport along"
299..352 Comment "// the path. A path between these paths remains owed."
353..355 Comment "//"
356..420 Comment "// - see: `ua-by-hand.gandr` — the magma degree telescope path"
421..505 Comment "// - see: `../identity/univalence-transports.gandr` — transport of a packaged path"
506..579 Comment "// - see: `pathological/identity/univalence-owed.gandr` — the owed path"
580..630 Comment "// - owes: #520 — the path between the two paths"
632..679 Comment "// The magma, the swap and the unit\'s identity."
